<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's PSBR falls year/year Jan-Nov 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal's PSBR falls year/year Jan-Nov 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's public sector borrowing requirement stood at 546.5 billion escudos between January and November 1996, a drop of 179.7 billion escudos compared with the same period of 1995, the Bank of Portugal said in its December report.</p>
</text>
